<title>USA: Tenneco names Stecko COO.</title>
<headline>Tenneco names Stecko COO.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tenneco Inc said on Tuesday that it has named Paul Stecko, currently president and chief executive officer of Tenneco Packaging, chief operating officer of Tenneco Inc, a new position.</p>
<p>The company's packaging and automotive parts businesses will report to Stecko.</p>
<p>The company also said that Thomas Evans, currently senior vice president of Tenneco Automotive and head of Walker Manufacturing, has been named president of Tenneco Automotive, reporting to Paul Stecko.</p>
<p>All Tenneco Automotive operating and staff functions, including Monroe Auto Equipment and Walker Manufacturing, will report to Evans.</p>
</text>
